OL,5,G1930 EFL Carabao Cup Live
OL,6,     FNottingham Forest v Leeds United
OL,7,     F(Kick-off 8.00pm). Mark Pougatch
OL,8,     Fpresents all the action from the
OL,9,     Fsecond-round tie at The City
OL,10,     FGround. This is the second meeting
OL,11,     Fbetween the sides here in the
OL,12,     Fspace of four days, with the teams
OL,13,     Falso facing each other in the
OL,14,     FPremier League on Saturday, and
OL,15,     Fboth teams will be looking to fare
OL,16,     Fbetter in this competition than
OL,17,     Fthey did last season. Forest
OL,18,     Freceived a bye to the third round,
OL,19,     Fbut lost at that stage away to
OL,20,     FSwansea City, and Leeds went out
OL,21,     Fon penalties at Sheffield
OL,22,     FWednesday in this round. With
